    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upload": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uploads are capped at %@ — an AFC write is a single call with no streaming form, so a larger file is refused rather than truncated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传上限为 %1$@——AFC 写入是单次调用，没有流式形式，因此更大的文件会被拒绝而不是被截断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upstream caps a selection at %lld descriptors, so an import past the cap is refused rather than silently dropped. Each pack is copied into this app — removing it on the PosterBoard page removes the copy, not the original file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上游将一次选择上限设为 %1$lld 个描述符，因此超过上限的导入会被拒绝，而不是被静默丢弃。每个包都会被复制到本应用中——在 PosterBoard 页面上移除它只会删除副本，不会删除原始文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upstream caps a selection at %lld descriptors. Each pack is copied into this app, so removing one here removes the copy — the file you imported is untouched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上游将一次选择上限设为 %1$lld 个描述符。每个包都会被复制到本应用中，因此在这里移除一个只会删除副本——你导入的文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VPN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VPN"
          }
        }
      }
