          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallet Cards (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钱包卡片（%1$lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpaper packs (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸包（%1$lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpapers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpapers are delivered as files into this app's own backup of the device, in the %@ domain — the same channel the tweaks use. Nothing is written to the device until Apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸以文件的形式交付到本应用自己的设备备份中，位于 %1$@ 域——与改机项使用相同的通道。在点击“应用”之前，不会向设备写入任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weight": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字重"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi Signal Bars": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi 信号格数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes %lld file(s) to the device:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向设备写入 %1$lld 个文件："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes /var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist. Disabling a daemon stops its service. Only the %lld labels shown here can ever reach the file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入 /var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist。禁用守护进程会停止其服务。只有此处显示的 %1$lld 个标签能够进入该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes a 0-byte file over %@. Upstream models this as a NullifyFileTweak: it removes a plist rather than writing one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 0 字节文件覆盖 %1$@。上游将其建模为 NullifyFileTweak：它会删除一个 plist，而不是写入一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes the descriptors into %@ over a tunnel and resprings, so it is live in seconds. No backup is taken, because nothing is delivered back to the device — but for the same reason it applies **only** the packs: tweaks need the backup, so they still go through the **Apply** button on the home page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过隧道将描述符写入 %1$@ 并重新加载 SpringBoard，因此几秒内即可生效。不会进行备份，因为没有任何内容被传回设备——但出于同样的原因，它**只**应用这些包：改机项需要备份，因此仍需通过主页上的“**应用**”按钮来应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨天，%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can get more tweaks, but they are untested with your iOS version. You can change your mind in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以获得更多改机项，但它们未经针对你的 iOS 版本测试。你可以在设置中改变主意。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已经是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your selection is saved to %@ on every change and restored on launch, exactly as the desktop app's AutoSave preset does (%@). Import is for a preset from elsewhere; entries this port does not carry are listed below rather than guessed at.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Your selection is saved to %1$@ on every change and restored on launch, exactly as the desktop app's AutoSave preset does (%2$@). Import is for a preset from elsewhere; entries this port does not carry are listed below rather than guessed at."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的选择在每次更改时都会保存到 %1$@，并在启动时恢复，与桌面版的自动保存预设完全相同（%2$@）。导入是用于从别处导入预设；本移植版没有的条目会在下面列出，而不是凭空猜测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS %@: each nulled file is written as a valid empty plist, not 0 bytes. A 0-byte plist is a truncated plist on this release and crashes SpringBoard at boot. An empty plist parses, and the system falls back to its own defaults.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS %1$@：每个被置空的文件都会写成一个有效的空 plist，而不是 0 字节。在这个版本上，0 字节的 plist 是被截断的 plist，会导致 SpringBoard 在启动时崩溃。空 plist 可以正常解析，系统会回退到自己的默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 builds the depth effect only for the modern (“Clownfish”) layout, so a pack made before iOS 27 is rewritten when it is applied — otherwise it installs and looks flat, with no depth. The rewrite re-stamps the family, drops external scripts and republishes the planes, and it is best effort: it can change how a wallpaper looks. A pack holding nothing pre-27 is left alone either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 只为现代（“Clownfish”）布局构建景深效果，因此在 iOS 27 之前制作的包在应用时会被重写——否则它虽然能安装，但看起来是平的，没有景深。重写会重新标记系列、删除外部脚本并重新发布图层，而且只是尽力而为：它可能会改变壁纸的外观。不含任何 iOS 27 之前内容的包则无论如何都不会被改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 only applies the depth effect to wallpapers in the modern format, so a legacy wallpaper is rewritten on import. Pick “Install as is” to push the original files untouched instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 只对现代格式的壁纸应用景深效果，因此旧版壁纸在导入时会被重写。选择“按原样安装”可改为推送未经改动的原始文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 status bar research": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 状态栏研究"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27+ — on iOS 26, use a file from a computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27+——在 iOS 26 上，请使用电脑上的文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nothing saved yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未保存任何内容"
          }
        }
